1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,050
Woman: I heard you joined the campus chess club. How's it going?

2
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:12,220
Man: Great! I'm learning a lot and meeting new people.

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,900
Woman: I've always wanted to learn to play

4
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:18,230
but I've never tried. Is everyone pretty advanced?

5
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:25,010
Man: No, not necessarily. There are members of all skill levels and everyone's very supportive.

6
00:00:25,010 --> 00:00:27,010
Woman: When do they meet?

7
00:00:27,010 --> 00:00:29,260
Man: Every Saturday afternoon at the student center.

8
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:32,440
Woman: Okay, I usually work at the library then

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:37,180
but they're very flexible, so I'm sure I could make it work.
